<title>CHILE: Chilgener raises $488 mln in rights issue.</title>
<headline>Chilgener raises $488 mln in rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's second largest power generator Chilgener SA said it has raised $488 million through a rights issue in local and international markets to finance new electricity projects in Latin America.</p>
<p>Existing shareholders subscribed for 98 percent of the capital increase agreed at a shareholder' meeting in March, said the statement.</p>
<p>Chilgener has investments in Argentina, Peru, Colombia and Brazil.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
